# IANA backzone (almanac-sourced), Eswatini / Swaziland (Mbabane) -- Mbabane Mean Time
# (+2:04:24) until Mar 1903, then SAST (+2:00) with NO wartime daylight saving; vs default
# link to Africa/Johannesburg (LMT +1:52 -> +1:30 SAST 1892 -> +2:00 with the SA war-DST
# rule +3:00 in the summers of 1942-43 and 1943-44). Eswatini kept +2:00 through both war
# summers, so it stands 1 hour BEHIND the default across 1942-09-20..1943-03-21 and
# 1943-09-19..1944-03-19; it also led the +1:30 default by ~34 min before Mar 1903.
#
# NOT Shanks-page-sourced: reproduces IANA's own backzone Africa/Mbabane exactly (the
